title: "The Reliability Stack: A Cross-Layer Taxonomy for Engineering Reliable AI Systems"
authors:
  - family-names: "Cura"
    given-names: "Oğuz Emre"
    affiliation: "Independent Researcher"
    email: "oguzemrecura@gmail.com"
