url: "https://github.com/oguzcura/reliability-stack"
abstract: >-
  A cross-layer taxonomy for engineering reliable AI systems. The paper treats
  reliability as an inherited property of an assembled stack rather than a score
  of a single model, organizes the reliability-bearing decisions into six layers,
  and derives a selection procedure from two axes: answer-space openness and cost
  of error. It carries an evidence-typed claim ledger and seven case studies.
keywords:
  - "AI reliability"
  - "reliability engineering"
  - "machine learning systems"
